        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Add WeakMap `has()` object reference comparison clarification]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41248</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41248"/>
        <updated>2025-09-22T16:20:10.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27073716?u=81f47323d0deffaee8fc1142089ac2dbaa46988c&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">The documentation does not clarify that <code class="notranslate">has()</code> uses object reference for comparison despite <code class="notranslate">WeakMap</code> only accepting objects and non-registered symbols.</p>
<p dir="auto">Object references are counter-intuitive to those unfamiliar with the language.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">The WeakMap documentation page highlights <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/WeakMap#caching" rel="nofollow">caching</a> as an use-case. Naively caching objects might result in unexpected behaviour, e.g.:</p>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-ts notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" dir="auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="import fsp from 'fs/promises';

const cache = new WeakMap();

for await (const file of fsp.glob('images/**/*')) {
	const raw = await fsp.readFile(file); // Uint8Array

	let cached = cache.get(raw);
	if (!cached) {
		cached = file;
		cache.set(raw, cached);
	} else {
		console.log(cached); // Will never reach
	}
}"><pre class="notranslate"><span class="pl-k">import</span> <span class="pl-s1">fsp</span> <span class="pl-k">from</span> <span class="pl-s">'fs/promises'</span><span class="pl-kos">;</span>

<span class="pl-k">const</span> <span class="pl-s1">cache</span> <span class="pl-c1">=</span> <span class="pl-k">new</span> <span class="pl-v">WeakMap</span><span class="pl-kos">(</span><span class="pl-kos">)</span><span class="pl-kos">;</span>

<span class="pl-k">for</span> <span class="pl-k">await</span> <span class="pl-kos">(</span><span class="pl-k">const</span> <span class="pl-s1">file</span> <span class="pl-k">of</span> <span class="pl-s1">fsp</span><span class="pl-kos">.</span><span class="pl-en">glob</span><span class="pl-kos">(</span><span class="pl-s">'images/**/*'</span><span class="pl-kos">)</span><span class="pl-kos">)</span> <span class="pl-kos">{</span>
	<span class="pl-k">const</span> <span class="pl-s1">raw</span> <span class="pl-c1">=</span> <span class="pl-k">await</span> <span class="pl-s1">fsp</span><span class="pl-kos">.</span><span class="pl-en">readFile</span><span class="pl-kos">(</span><span class="pl-s1">file</span><span class="pl-kos">)</span><span class="pl-kos">;</span> <span class="pl-c">// Uint8Array</span>

	<span class="pl-k">let</span> <span class="pl-s1">cached</span> <span class="pl-c1">=</span> <span class="pl-s1">cache</span><span class="pl-kos">.</span><span class="pl-en">get</span><span class="pl-kos">(</span><span class="pl-s1">raw</span><span class="pl-kos">)</span><span class="pl-kos">;</span>
	<span class="pl-k">if</span> <span class="pl-kos">(</span><span class="pl-c1">!</span><span class="pl-s1">cached</span><span class="pl-kos">)</span> <span class="pl-kos">{</span>
		<span class="pl-s1">cached</span> <span class="pl-c1">=</span> <span class="pl-s1">file</span><span class="pl-kos">;</span>
		<span class="pl-s1">cache</span><span class="pl-kos">.</span><span class="pl-en">set</span><span class="pl-kos">(</span><span class="pl-s1">raw</span><span class="pl-kos">,</span> <span class="pl-s1">cached</span><span class="pl-kos">)</span><span class="pl-kos">;</span>
	<span class="pl-kos">}</span> <span class="pl-k">else</span> <span class="pl-kos">{</span>
		<span class="pl-smi">console</span><span class="pl-kos">.</span><span class="pl-en">log</span><span class="pl-kos">(</span><span class="pl-s1">cached</span><span class="pl-kos">)</span><span class="pl-kos">;</span> <span class="pl-c">// Will never reach</span>
	<span class="pl-kos">}</span>
<span class="pl-kos">}</span></pre></div>
<p dir="auto">This implementation will never cache, even if the images are duplicates.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/WeakMap/has" rel="nofollow">WeakMap.prototype.has() (MDN)</a></li>
<li><a href="https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/keyed-collections.html#sec-weakmap.prototype.has" rel="nofollow">3.4 WeakMap.prototype.has (key) (ECMAScript® 2026 Language Specification)</a></li>
<li><a href="https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/abstract-operations.html#sec-samevalue" rel="nofollow">7.2.9 SameValue (x, y) (ECMAScript® 2026 Language Specification)</a></li>
</ul>]]></content>
